          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.088,
            0.848,
            0.146
          ],
          "content": "equal parts, and 4 such parts are taken. Hence, 1.4 lies between 1 and 2. Draw the number line and divide the unit between 1 and 2 into 10 equal parts. Take the fourth part, and we have 1.4 on the number line."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
